Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.86,0:01:56.78,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,The sky, dark and foreboding...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.79,0:02:09.46,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,...as the storm intensifies!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.63,0:02:17.72,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Across Onigashima...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.89,0:02:27.31,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,...the Blue Dragon's bellow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.06,0:02:33.90,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,The mad howling of a legion of beasts!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.16,0:02:45.50,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,At the Port of Habu...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.83,0:02:51.34,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,...the passing of a seasonal shower...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.34,0:02:57.09,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,...dyes the leaves\Nof the maple in autumn's red!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.18,0:03:05.60,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,This is a tale of loyalty,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.94,0:03:12.69,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,of the retainers who risked it all\Nto avenge their lord, Kozuki Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.53,0:03:18.53,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Though I may lack in eloquence...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.53,0:03:19.20,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.87,0:03:20.53,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Red Scabbards!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.53,0:03:28.29,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,...I shall do my best\Nto recount the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.71,0:03:33.05,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Now...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.38,0:03:37.47,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Upon twilight of the day\Nof the Fire Festival,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.55,0:03:41.80,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,before a stormy, rain-filled night...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.97,0:03:45.39,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Leaving behind the\Nboisterous Flower Capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.39,0:03:51.40,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke and his retinue make their way toward\NTokage Port, attempting to catch up to Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.07,0:03:55.99,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Are you not going out to sea, Yamato?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.99,0:03:59.74,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Aye, I am not!\NI have already told Luffy and his crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.74,0:04:02.16,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,So you are staying, Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.16,0:04:03.33,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Should I not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.33,0:04:06.08,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Nay, 'tis reassuring\Nto have you here...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.50,0:04:10.33,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,But did you not say something about\Nmaking a decision earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.67,0:04:12.09,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.09,0:04:15.67,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Oden began by traveling\Nacross this country, did he not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.67,0:04:17.51,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,I know so little\Nof the world myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.84,0:04:20.93,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,So I shall follow in his footsteps,\None day setting out to sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.93,0:04:22.51,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,That is my decision!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.51,0:04:23.76,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,What's this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.76,0:04:27.02,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Luffy and his crew already\Ndiscussed this with you, Yamato?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.02,0:04:31.35,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,This angers me all the more!\NThey dare mock me unto the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.69,0:04:35.69,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Why do they depart without bidding\Neither me or Kin'emon farewell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.69,0:04:36.94,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.45,0:04:41.61,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.95,0:04:50.04,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Your father was a fool of a lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.79,0:04:55.29,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Who might you be,\Nand what business brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.88,0:04:59.55,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,I'm Luffy.\NThe future Pirate King!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.55,0:05:01.47,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,You, a samurai?!\NWhatta load!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.47,0:05:05.05,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm gonna be the Pirate King\None day, so there, knucklehead!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.30,0:05:11.31,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Then I shall be Shogun of the\NLand of Wano one day, you buffoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.31,0:05:13.98,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Whuzzat, ya slimy eel?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.98,0:05:15.57,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Arrogant monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.57,0:05:16.98,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Who ya callin' a monkey?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.15,0:05:20.90,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Are you just a puppet, Momo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.07,0:05:26.41,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna just cry?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.74,0:05:31.41,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,I wish to fell Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.08,0:05:34.33,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Let's team up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.25,0:05:37.34,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,An alliance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.34,0:05:40.01,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.84,0:05:44.26,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,That's right, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.68,0:05:46.93,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.76,0:05:50.77,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,...just some topknotted runt,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.77,0:05:54.60,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,always bossin' people around\Neven though you're just a dumb scaredy-cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.60,0:05:56.94,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Do what ya gotta to stay alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.94,0:06:01.19,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna rescue you,\Nno matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.36,0:06:04.36,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,'Cause we're pals!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.28,0:06:09.29,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,I'll ask one more time, runt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.79,0:06:11.45,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,What's your name?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.37,0:06:13.96,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Hear my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.96,0:06:16.63,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.29,0:06:17.79,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.88,0:06:18.96,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.96,0:06:20.88,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,...the future Shogun...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.88,0:06:26.39,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,...of the Land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.22,0:06:28.97,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Go, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.22,0:06:32.81,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,You can fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.81,0:06:33.64,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.48,0:06:36.98,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Go stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.98,0:06:40.23,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,...Onigashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.32,0:06:45.57,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,As for Kaido,\NI'm gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.49,0:06:48.91,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,...one hundred percent...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.91,0:06:51.66,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,beat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.41,0:06:56.33,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,We may not be the best of friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.33,0:06:59.42,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,but we journeyed together for so long,\Nand yet you feel nothing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.17,0:07:04.42,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,How horrible you are!\NI thought you a better man than that, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.42,0:07:08.34,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,He confuses freedom with disrespect!\NAm I not right, Kin'emon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.34,0:07:10.85,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,You are most correct!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.85,0:07:14.43,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,If I might inquire, Momonosuke-sama,\Nwhy do you not take flight?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.27,0:07:16.02,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.02,0:07:18.94,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!\NI apologize for my rudeness!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.19,0:07:23.78,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,You are the true Shogun of Wano now,\NMomonosuke-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.78,0:07:27.86,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Depending on Luffy-dono's response,\Nit is regretful, but we may have to cut him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.86,0:07:30.53,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Indeed! Such is\Nthe way of the samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.53,0:07:33.37,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,You said we were pals, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.37,0:07:35.71,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,You needn't be so angry...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.71,0:07:38.54,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,He humiliated me!\NHe shall pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.87,0:07:41.29,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,First, I punch!\NThen, bite!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.29,0:07:43.46,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,And then... Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.46,0:07:46.38,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Whatever the case,\NI will bring him to bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.97,0:07:54.14,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Next time I see you guys,\Nwe're total enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.56,0:07:56.64,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,No complaints,\Nnot even if I murder you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.23,0:07:58.81,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Nope, won't hear any from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.81,0:08:00.81,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Bye, Traf!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.81,0:08:01.81,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Shuddup.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.81,0:08:02.98,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Whuuuuh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.98,0:08:04.98,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Later, Jaggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.98,0:08:06.74,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,You're next in line\Nto be ground meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.90,0:08:09.57,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Shove off and ship out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.41,0:08:16.08,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.59,0:08:27.34,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,You lot, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.26,0:08:30.01,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Wait one moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.84,0:08:33.51,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Hey! We came to send you off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.51,0:08:36.02,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke, Kin'emon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.02,0:08:37.93,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Yamato-chwan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.35,0:08:42.77,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.77,0:08:43.61,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Uweeeh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.61,0:08:45.44,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,I have you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.44,0:08:47.44,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.28,0:08:49.70,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.70,0:08:53.20,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.20,0:08:57.12,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Leaving without a word to us,\Nwe who have known you for longer than any other?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.12,0:08:57.62,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Heeh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.37,0:09:01.96,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,You have incensed the Shogun and myself!\NExplain yourself at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.96,0:09:03.79,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Well, we're meetin' now, ain't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.79,0:09:06.38,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.38,0:09:08.71,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,By order of the Shogun...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.71,0:09:10.72,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,W-Whaddya want?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.64,0:09:19.39,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Dod't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.39,0:09:21.98,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,I'll mizz you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.15,0:09:27.65,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Pweaze, stay with me! Forevuh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.65,0:09:32.40,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,I do not want to be\Nseparated from you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.34,0:09:52.93,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,You were the very reasons...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.93,0:09:54.68,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,...for my continued existence!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.26,0:09:57.10,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,You were the very reasons...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.51,0:09:59.60,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,...I was able to smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.52,0:10:04.94,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,I thank you for avenging...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.94,0:10:07.36,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,...my father and mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.94,0:10:13.28,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,I am weak of mind,\Nand cannot find the words...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.95,0:10:16.37,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,But, I fear what is to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.37,0:10:18.45,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,So please, do not go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.29,0:10:21.12,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Kinda pathetic, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.12,0:10:24.46,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Momo-chan's still just a child...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.13,0:10:28.29,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.46,0:10:31.21,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Gotcha, it's all set!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.21,0:10:32.72,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.39,0:10:39.22,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,We were standin' by on the Sunny\Nso we could hand this over to ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.22,0:10:41.14,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Some "Shogun" you are, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.72,0:10:45.06,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,You might be bigger in size,\Nbut we know who ya are on the inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.06,0:10:48.06,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Yer just a stupid dumbhead scaredy-cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.65,0:10:53.24,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.32,0:10:56.74,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,...I think of ya\Nas my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.08,0:11:01.49,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.74,0:11:02.16,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.50,0:11:04.58,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,A flag?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.16,0:11:08.17,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,When the times get tough,\Njust remember our adventure on the seas!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.17,0:11:10.59,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,An' fly this over Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.09,0:11:14.17,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,If trouble comes knockin',\Njust flash this at 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.76,0:11:21.10,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,If someone picks a fight with one of us,\Nthey're pickin' a fight with all of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.43,0:11:26.44,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,"One of us"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.19,0:11:28.85,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,You mean, I am one of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.54,0:11:44.95,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon, Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.95,0:11:45.62,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon, Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.96,0:11:47.04,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.62,0:11:53.05,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,If yous wanna be pirates,\Nwe'll come by to pick ya up anytime!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.05,0:11:54.71,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,And no wimps allowed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.72,0:12:05.47,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.47,0:12:07.39,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Steady as she goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.66,0:12:30.92,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.92,0:12:32.17,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Mmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.17,0:12:33.42,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.42,0:12:35.59,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,All the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.59,0:12:36.59,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.59,0:12:38.92,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Shogun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.92,0:12:41.09,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.09,0:12:43.51,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,No sobbin' from now on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.10,0:12:48.77,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Look after yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.77,0:12:50.44,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,We'll meet again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.44,0:12:52.02,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.89,0:13:26.97,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.97,0:13:27.64,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Yes, m'lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.64,0:13:32.31,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,I shall surpass Kozuki Oden someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.73,0:13:38.23,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,And I shall see it through!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.65,0:13:39.57,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Surpass me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.57,0:13:40.82,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,No, not you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.91,0:13:49.83,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Okay...\NTo Hakumai!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.83,0:13:54.08,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,I was told there's an official port\Nwith a lift to lower ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.58,0:13:57.00,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.00,0:14:00.67,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Having climbed a waterfall to get here,\NI thought we would also be plunging off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.84,0:14:08.85,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Ah! Straw Hat and Trafalgar...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.85,0:14:12.02,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Usin' the official port, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.27,0:14:18.44,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Somethin' regular-ass pirates\Nlike you oughta use!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.44,0:14:22.28,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,'Cause after all,\Nit's nice 'n harmless!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.86,0:14:26.87,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Harm...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.87,0:14:27.87,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,...less?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.87,0:14:30.70,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Perfect for followers like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.12,0:14:33.71,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Follow...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.71,0:14:34.87,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,...ers?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.87,0:14:36.12,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,No, don't, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.12,0:14:38.79,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Harmless is good!\NDon't take the bait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.79,0:14:41.21,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Huh?\NCaptain, why're you makin' that face?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.21,0:14:43.47,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Using the official port's totally okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.47,0:14:44.80,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Shaddup and just follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.80,0:14:45.63,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.63,0:14:46.72,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,You don't got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.72,0:14:48.22,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Stop the Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.22,0:14:49.89,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Jinbe, lemme take the helm!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.89,0:14:51.47,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Luffyyyy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.47,0:14:53.56,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Captain, just don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.99,0:15:14.91,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,The fellow rebels that Momonosuke-sama\Nand Kin'emon brought in tow...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.50,0:15:18.42,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,As though they were\Nthe true Wisdom Kings,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.42,0:15:22.00,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,they raged on like typhoons!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.17,0:15:25.42,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Neither the Dragon King, Kaido,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.76,0:15:29.09,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,nor the monstrous Oiran-fiend,\Ncould match their fury!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.09,0:15:32.68,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Their death throes\Nrent the sky asunder!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.52,0:15:41.36,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, there was Orochi,\Nthought to have burned to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.28,0:15:48.36,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Out of spite, he threw himself\Nupon the Princess Hiyori!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.03,0:15:52.45,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Slash!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.12,0:15:58.71,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,And just like that, with a single swipe of the blade,\Nsomeone cut him down...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.29,0:16:03.55,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,'Twas none other than\NKozuki Oden's second disciple, Denjiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.30,0:16:06.72,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,And so, Orochi's remaining head\Nwas set ablaze!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.47,0:16:11.72,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Such was the end\Nof Kurozumi Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.81,0:16:15.64,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Much like the rumbling of thunder,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.64,0:16:19.39,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,so fell Onigashima\Nand the Dragon King, Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.40,0:16:22.98,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,The dark clouds...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.48,0:16:27.40,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,...cast across the skies of\Nthe Land of Wano for some twenty-odd years...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.65,0:16:29.40,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,...ever so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.24,0:16:33.91,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,...slowly clear away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.99,0:16:42.25,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,With the sounds of the Flower Capital's\Nfestival music in the distance...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.59,0:16:47.42,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.67,0:16:52.84,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Burning like mad,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.84,0:16:57.68,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Orochi, ever-glaring\Nin our direction, said this:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.19,0:17:03.86,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,"The Kurozumi Clan's grudge...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.94,0:17:12.20,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,"...will curse this country\Nfor generations to come!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.20,0:17:18.29,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,One could see the twenty years\Nof Wano's suffering in Princess Hiyori's eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.29,0:17:20.21,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Then, her gaze of steadfastness!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.71,0:17:22.79,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,"'Tis dangerous, Hiyori-sama!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.29,0:17:26.63,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Cried Denjiro the samurai,\Nbut she brushed him aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.21,0:17:31.38,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Our beloved Princess Hiyori gave not\Nany quarter to the burning Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.38,0:17:33.89,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Instead, she spoke to him his requiem!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.64,0:17:36.56,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Fan in hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.56,0:17:38.14,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,...bearing the Kozuki family crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.14,0:17:41.39,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,She bit upon her lip,\Nrecalling the twenty years of anguish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.81,0:17:44.56,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,"O Father, O Mother, O Brother..."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.56,0:17:48.15,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,And she thought\Nof her homeland, and said!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.15,0:17:48.73,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.73,0:17:49.82,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.82,0:17:53.32,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Come, dear audience!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.74,0:17:58.41,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,"If it does not burn...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.41,0:18:02.66,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,"...then it is not charcoal!"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.01,0:18:19.10,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Upon twilight of the day\Nof the Fire Festival...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.52,0:18:28.69,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,The "Reversed Crescent Moon,"\Nmarking the port of rendezvous
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.44,0:18:36.78,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,'Tis a tale of the bloody battles...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.78,0:18:40.62,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,...to take revenge, to rebuild a clan...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.62,0:18:52.38,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,...that shall be passed down\Nfor generations to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.64,0:19:00.14,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Such is the tale of...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.14,0:19:04.81,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,...the return of these\Nlegendary samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.31,0:19:09.23,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,My time here today\Nis just about at its end!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.98,0:19:12.82,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,If you might permit me\Npause for today...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.57,0:19:15.74,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,I hope that we...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.32,0:19:19.07,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,...might meet again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.66,0:19:21.66,Main-HatSubs,,0,0,0,,Where shall we fly the flag?
